# Org context hub

This repository is `xq-context-hub`, the AI context home for org `chauhaidang`.

## Always

- Start from `AGENTS.md` and `CONTEXT-MAP.md`
- Load only the domain `CONTEXT.md` needed for the current task
- Use glossary terms from the selected domain
- Keep org conventions from `org/conventions.md` when discussing packages,
  secrets, or commits

## Never

- Preload every domain and org file into context
- Commit secrets or tokens
- Commit or push unless the user explicitly asks
- Duplicate `xq-harness` engineering workflow skills into this hub

## Skills

- `use-context-hub` — navigate map → domain
- `add-domain-context` — add or extend a domain
